'''Hatsune Miku''' is an [[:Category:Uber Rare Cats|Uber Rare Cat]] that was added in [[Version 9.4 Update|Version 9.4]] and can be unlocked by playing the [[Cat Capsule#Rare Capsule|Rare Capsule]] during the [[Hatsune Miku Collaboration Event]].

{{Cat Info
|ID = 535
|rarity = UR
|name1 = Hatsune Miku
|name2 = Hatsune Miku CC
}}

==Evolution==
Evolves into '''Hatsune Miku CC''' at level 10.

==Strategy/Usage==
Hatsune Miku is a multi-purpose unit, acting as a midrange rusher, attacker and, to some extent, a tanker versus her effective traits. Her effective damage is enough to one-shot annoying peons such as [[Ginger Snache]], [[Gabriel]], [[Mr. Angel]] and [[Brollow]], but it still results in low DPS for her range. Her weaken ability helps her live longer, but the duration is low. She doesn't work well as a tanker due to having too many knockbacks for one, and not having a lot of effective health compared to most other tankers. Although she could fit as a rusher, the average speed for one would be 30 or higher. Overall, despite being a multi-purpose unit, she is the master of none.

{{Job|Classification = Midranger}}

